  "description": "Part of the Axiom family. The LDB database: tables with typed columns in fixed-size rows, a heap for values of any size, B+ tree indexes, unique and foreign keys, transactions across tables, predicates with a planner, and aggregates, on the LDB storage engine.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
